# Build context sent to the Docker daemon. Smaller context = faster builds and
# no chance of leaking local junk into your image.
#
# THE classic beginner bug: forgetting to ignore node_modules, then copying your
# host's macOS binaries into a Linux image. Always ignore it.
node_modules
dist
coverage
npm-debug.log*

# Never bake secrets or local env files into an image.
.env
.env.*

.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.md
